  "_technique": "Duotone-relief architecture (resolves strict-two-tone vs visible-emboss tension): FN(Basic,BLOCK,static evolution) -> Mosaic(sharp cells) -> Posterize(2) BINARIZES BASE -> Emboss(blend 78, on binary field so only lips go grey) -> Tint(continuous, LAST). Key: binarize the base BEFORE emboss so the ONLY non-binary values Tint sees are the relief lips => pure navy/cream cells + grey-lip relief edges. Posterize AFTER emboss (or levels>2) muddies; emboss AFTER tint desaturates."
